由 Codex 接续补做 agent-adaptor PR #30 的本机影子验收（审查标识：便便）。

Exercise native comparison, actual comment receipts, queued next runs, cancel/restart and Chat UI through the real daemon. Require independent host arithmetic acceptance and actual generated unittest completion, preserving bound command receipts and failure reports. Keep model execution explicitly opt-in and provide offline counterexample regressions.
